    { math: '4 · Fatigue: death by repetition', note: 'Failures below yield strength, cycle after cycle — cracks initiate at stress concentrators, grow a little per cycle, then snap. ~90% of mechanical service failures are fatigue; the S-N curve and damage accumulation (Miner\'s rule) design against it.' },
